  "title": "Coup of 18-19 Brumaire",
  "summary": "On 9–10 November 1799 (18–19 Brumaire) Napoleon Bonaparte and allies overthrew the French Directory in a bloodless coup and replaced it with the Consulate. The two legislative assemblies were moved to the Château de Saint-Cloud under the pretext of a plot. Many historians regard the coup as ending the French Revolution.",
